  "decontamination_notes": "Real bug fix from santhsecurity/vyre commit 0685fea4, after model training cutoffs. The collect_vars_in_expr function in vyre-foundation's loop_fusion pass collected index and value from Expr::Atomic but not the expected operand of a compare-exchange, letting a cross-loop scalar read go undetected. Self-contained 2-file Rust crate with zero external dependencies. LICENSE: MIT OR Apache-2.0. Coverage floor: 2 fail_to_pass tests (CAS expected creates dependency; CAS expected is distinct from value operand).",
  "grader": "tests",
  "tests": {
    "fail_to_pass": [
      {"name": "cas_expected_creates_dep", "cmd": "cargo test --offline --test vb_loop_fusion_cas cas_expected_creates_scalar_dependency"},
      {"name": "cas_expected_separate_from_value", "cmd": "cargo test --offline --test vb_loop_fusion_cas cas_expected_is_separate_from_value_operand"}
    ],
    "pass_to_pass": [
      {"name": "plain_var_dep_detected", "cmd": "cargo test --offline --test vb_regression_cas non_atomic_scalar_dep_still_detected"},
      {"name": "disjoint_no_dep", "cmd": "cargo test --offline --test vb_regression_cas no_dep_on_disjoint_scalars"},
      {"name": "cas_no_false_positive", "cmd": "cargo test --offline --test vb_regression_cas cas_without_expected_var_must_not_false_positive"},
      {"name": "dep_swapped_direction", "cmd": "cargo test --offline --test vb_loop_fusion_cas cas_expected_creates_dep_swapped_loops"}
    ]
  },
